  "description": "Shared code style rules for Personix .NET projects, delivered as a global AnalyzerConfig together with a small analyzer for rules no built-in one covers. Referencing the package turns the agreed style rules — braces on every control-flow statement among them — into build errors, so the rules hold in CI instead of relying on everyone having the same editor settings.",
