  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — adds an analyzer with PERSONIX005 (setter used only during object creation should be init) and PERSONIX006 (init property set at every creation should be required). 1.0.5 — Release notes brought up to date, no rule changes. 1.0.4 made IDE0022 give generated methods a block body instead of an expression body. 1.0.3 added IDE1006 naming rules for private fields.",
